* 3 Nov 26 dm  S.96 M1b: the second kind, the DICTIONARY ITEMS of the account's files (K switches).  The reading of an account is one routine, collect.account, used by the list of the
*              account under the cursor and by the find in every account; a dictionary item matches a text in its id OR its column heading (the owner's example: "display all dictionary
*              items with the name First Name"; which of the two he meant is his to say, so both).
* 3 Nov 26 dm  New (S.96 M1a; owner, 31 Oct 2026: "pointers seem to me to be a good way to do it").  The VOC kind only, READ ONLY; programs, and the editing, are later
